# Line endings and binary assets.
#
# tools/build_models.py writes models with LF. Without this file, core.autocrlf
# checks them out as CRLF and every rebuild shows 22 modified files that contain
# no real change. Declaring eol=lf keeps the working tree, the index and Blender
# in agreement, so a rebuild is byte-identical unless the model actually changed.
*.obj text eol=lf

# Images and archives must never be line-ending converted or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.zip binary
*.dll binary
